<title>USA: Metalclad Corp Q1 shr loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Metalclad Corp Q1 shr loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>NEWPORT BEACH, Calif. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996	    1995</p>
<p> Revenues				   $1,918,000     $3,770,000</p>
<p> Net Loss				   ( 992,000)   ( 1,485,000)</p>
<p> Per Share					( .03)	   ( .09)</p>
<p> Weighted Average Number of Shares  28,738,370     16,948,754</p>
<p>NOTE: In accordance with the company's previously announced Mexican joint venture, BFI-Omega, the company's reported revenues from operations in Mexico will decrease as its operations transition to the joint venture. BFI-Omega is accounted for under the equity method in the company's financial statements and, therefore, revenues are not reported. Thus, while revenues appear to be decreasing, BFI-Omega's revenues for the quarter are up approximately 27 percent over the prior year.</p>
</text>
